{"channelId":"UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","row":["Wholistic Healing Experiences",98,"We believe everyone should enjoy a pain-free and active life. The highly trained massage therapists at Wholistic Healing Experiences use proven techniques to help you feel better and look forward to improved mobility and performance.\n\nWhen you’re in pain, it’s easy to feel frustrated, even hopeless.\n\nIf you’re like us, stress and pain just lead to more problems. Without important self-care you may have even found yourself falling down the spiral of self-medicating and other unhealthy behaviors. How do you find a path out of pain and despair?\n\nAt Wholistic Healing, we get it. Pain’s impact on your well-being is real. For more than 20 years, we’ve helped thousands of people just like you overcome pain and stress to experience relief.\n \nWe are committed to helping you overcome your pain so you can stop feeling limited–both physically and mentally.\n\nYou deserve relief. We’re here to help you get back to your life of mobility, productivity, and creativity.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:04.869Z","channelId":"UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e9716e86a62ef5cf7d8d310084d66ecf8849312d2f23939b8ea0d73830c4ad36","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1c0192057e051244b913be10c89cf5506334df8ed8088e486ffe79dcf49e69a9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:04.869Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":98,"raw":"98 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYTJZ67Vrn-1ZyjDxvjZTFg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:04.869Z"}],"emails":[],"cont